# Fine-tune MiVOLO (age regression + gender classification) on custom data.
# Original author: Robin Jacob Roy
#
# This revision keeps the custom Dataset (6-channel face+body stack, dual target)
# and training loop, but delegates optimisation to timm's factories:
#   create_optimizer_v2 -> layer-wise LR decay + bias/norm weight-decay filtering
#   create_scheduler_v2 -> warmup + cosine, per-update stepping
#   NativeScaler        -> AMP scale/backward/unscale/clip/step/update
#   ModelEmaV3          -> weight averaging
#   CheckpointSaver     -> top-N retention + model_best.pth.tar
#
# NOTE ON SCHEDULER SEMANTICS: timm schedulers are NOT torch.optim.lr_scheduler
# compatible. A bare scheduler.step() silently misbehaves. You must call
# step_update(num_updates=...) per iteration and step(epoch + 1, metric=...) per
# epoch. That is done below.

